+| 12 | **Dark/Light Mode** | Toggle between dark and light themes — preference persisted in localStorage. Status text colors (e.g. "Running", "Pending") are theme-aware so they stay readable in every theme, not just dark ones |
 | 13 | **Error Boundaries** | Graceful render-error recovery per component with "Try Again" fallback UI |
